model success  the fastest way to accomplish any goal  any challenge you have for yourself  is to model success find people who've  already done what you're trying to do  and put their strategies to work for you  otherwise if you try to think of every  new idea yourself come up with every  answer yourself  you're going to keep beating your head  against brick walls and not seeing the  results that you deserve  for your business i got a great question  from one of my youtube viewers  noreen who's trying to start a cosmetic  climb and wanted my advice on how to  start a cosmetic line  so i haven't started cosmetic line  before but if i was going into that  business what i would do is try to model  success  i would look at who has started some of  the most successful  cosmetic lines in the business and how  do they do it  not how did they make an extra million  dollars now but how did they start how  did they go from  i have an idea for a product and get it  in the department stores  i look at people at coco chanel how did  coco chanel get started and what lessons  can you learn from her success  i know one of her strategies in the  early days was she would go to  department stores  and hand out samples of her perfume and  when the buyer  came and said what are you doing and  when she saw that everybody seemed to be  really liking her perfume  that helped make a deal possible for  coco chanel where otherwise she couldn't  get the chance  to open the door but that's one example  look at all of these successful cosmetic  lines  and see how they got started what were  the factors that led to their success  how did they get their first  customer and model them i remember when  i had my first company  i really struggled at the beginning i  was making 300 bucks a month  not enough to survive i almost gave up  repeatedly  and uh was willing to try anything i  felt like i tried everything  and and nothing was working out i had a  great product and i couldn't understand  why this was so hard because the books i  read and the websites i visited  and the shows i watched everything  seemed to be so easy like follow these  eight steps and you'll be successful  well i followed those eight steps a  million times  and i wasn't successful and one of the  big breakthroughs for me  came when i realized that i wasn't the  first guy to try to do this before  my first company was a software company  and i had no background in software  before  apart from using you know a computer but  i wasn't a software designer  and the breakthrough moment came when i  did realize that i'm not the first guy  to try to sell software before and i  went and i modeled  some of the largest and most successful  software companies in the world and one  in particular was microsoft  and again i don't care how bill gates  makes money now but how did he go  from nothing from that idea to getting  his first customer what did he do what  did he say what were his actions what  was what was his mindset  who did he need to connect with and i  took those strategies and applied them  to my business  and i finally started to see results  for him was through partnerships so he  made partnerships he had software he  partnered with hardware companies  his big deal came with ibm was a seven  million dollar deal that first one with  ibm  that really put the company on the map  but before that he still made  partnerships with other  hardware companies and they sold their  their products as a bundle  and so i applied that strategy and  within the first month  i closed my first partnership deal and i  made 13 and a half thousand dollars  now that may not seem like a lot of  money to you 13k but to me i'm making  300 bucks a month this was  this was like eureka oh my god i struck  it rich this is amazing  somebody actually believes in what i'm  doing i'm seeing some positive momentum  finally after all this failure and  struggling  and i just kept copying that again and i  applied it again and again and again and  closed more partnerships and more  partnerships and continued to grow my  business and eventually  uh got acquired by someone who was a  potential partner they loved us so much  that they wanted to buy my business  and i wish i had discovered it earlier i  wish i discovered the strategy so much  earlier  because i almost shut down like i almost  quit my business and thought maybe i  should  listen to my friends and go back and get  a job  and i'm so grateful that i didn't but i  came close many times to having to do  that  and so if you're struggling with your  business right now if you don't have a  lot of experience  in in the field and it's a first time  thing for you you can't get this thing  off the ground  model success find someone who has done  it who's had success  in your field look at the cosmetic lines  company see how they did it  learn from their mistakes so you don't  have to make all the mistakes yourself  and you crunch down your learning curve  so instead of it taking you years and  years and years to achieve success you  can do it a lot  faster because you're modeling things  that work so i've never had success in  the cosmetic  field but i could have it and to do it i  just modeled the people who've had a lot  of success doing it  apply their strategies and make it work  for me and it can work for you too  believe for those of you watching you  like the video  please give it a thumbs up below it  always makes me want to do more for you  and  i love seeing your comments come in they  really make a difference for me  and give me a strong impact every time i  read them in the morning  so please leave a comment below if you  have a question leave it underneath i'll  make a video response  thank you so much and i'll see you soon

